.TH SRCTHREAD 1
.SH NAME
srcthread \- Local\-first research threads over pinned source mirrors.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsrcthread\fR [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local\-first research threads over pinned source mirrors.
.PP
Declare stores, pin source mirrors, and keep research threads with
anchors and offline excerpts. The same binary runs the socket daemon
(`srcthread daemon`) and the rune desktop UI (`srcthread desktop`).
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C, \-\-cd\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Change to DIR before running (and prefer its store, later)
.TP
\fB\-\-store\fR \fI<STORE>\fR
Active store name or path (overrides default selection)
.TP
\fB\-q, \-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-error messages
.TP
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fR
Extra output (\-vv for more)
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
